{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We included 18 patients with PD (Table S1) who exhibited severe motor fluctuations and varying deficits of gait and balance.\",\n    \"Participants were implanted with DBS leads in the left and right STN (Fig. 1A), which were either externalized for five days after surgery (n = 8) or directly connected to an implantable pulse generator with sensing capabilities22 (Percept PC, Medtronic, USA) (n = 10).\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We exploited this platform in 18 patients with Parkinson’s disease, which allowed us to demonstrate that the subthalamic nucleus encodes the initiation, termination, and vigor of leg muscle activation.\",\n    \"20 patients with Parkinson’s disease were recruited for the study.\",\n    \"Overall, 17 patients were retained for analyses on the neurorobotic platform and 12 for gait experiments.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"We finally configured our machine learning classification platform to predict the occurrence of periods during which feet are “glued to the ground” (Fig. 8B,C).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告关于4名患者的说法有全文依据，但缺少关键限定：这4人是出现频繁冻结步态（FOG）的患者子集，并非整个研究的样本量。全文明确报告了18名PD患者参与研究，同时说明有4名患者出现频繁FOG事件，且研究使用双侧STN-LFP记录。因此，如果报告将4人作为FOG分析的样本量，事实基本成立；如果将其作为整个研究的样本量，则会造成分母误读。故评为partly。关于发表状态，附件全文明确标注为medRxiv预印本，并明确说明尚未经过同行评审认证，因此报告的预印本标注有直接文本依据。不过，这只能证明所提供的版本是预印本，不能证明该研究后来没有正式发表。另一方面，指控者关于4人属于FOG分析子集的说法得到全文明确支持，但其所称总体纳入18人需要进一步限定：摘要和结果部分报告18人，而Materials and Methods明确写明20名患者被招募，最终17人保留用于神经机器人平台分析、12人用于步态实验分析。因此，18人不能不加区分地等同于方法部分的初始招募人数。至于2022年正式发表于Science Translational Medicine及DOI 10.1126/scitranslmed.abo1800，所提供的全文没有出现该期刊名称或该DOI，无法仅凭附件核实。综合而言，指控者对FOG子集的解释正确，但总体样本量表述和正式发表状态均不能完全由附件全文支持，故评为partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2843928c-2be2-47b5-97e5-6b8de7f901ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125452807561Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.532, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:55:59.340526+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4fda3029ac0a704aaeaa6ac7ef89d2aa4a5942ed9208ff1f65c2488d605f879", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125452807561Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png"